# Whitespace here is significant to a consumer that is not Prettier.
#
# about.hbs generates the Rust half of THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md, which is
# Markdown: Prettier indents Handlebars tags, and cargo-about renders that
# indentation literally, turning every license section into an indented code
# block under an empty heading. Formatting this file silently corrupts a
# generated artifact, so it is left alone.
src-tauri/about.hbs

